{"asset_key":"ep2/quest_story_12226080","episode":"ep2","category":"quest_story","story_id":"12226080","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:2:1222608001:0":{"text":"どこに行っても、やれグレイヴボーンが出た、やれ死海の艦隊が戻ってくるって大騒ぎだ！","source_cn":"老戴夫！我走到哪都能听见别人说亡灵又来了，死潮舰队又要来了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE712FF09BF577172","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1222608002:0":{"text":"せっかく落ち着いたのに、おめぇはまた街のみんなを不安にさせてえのか！？","source_cn":"你想毁了锈锚港好不容易才得到的安宁？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8F860501657B7395","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1222608003:0":{"text":"俺は死海の艦隊だなんて一言も言ってねえぞ！","source_cn":"我可从来没提过什么死潮舰队！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB9B1ADFC8608A764","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1222608004:0":{"text":"でも女のグレイヴボーンを見たのは本当だ！嘘じゃねえ！","source_cn":"但我真的看见了女亡灵！那不是造谣，是事实！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3C267F71295D1E80","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1222608005:0":{"text":"俺だって昨日、死海の艦隊が店に押し入ってくるのを見たぜ、夢の中でな！寝言は寝て言えってんだ！","source_cn":"别发癔症，你把自己做的梦当真了。我昨晚还梦见死潮舰队走...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF63D455184DBA4DA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1222608006:1":{"text":"はっ！夢の中でちびったのか？布団は洗ったんだろうな？","source_cn":"怎么着，睁开眼你发现自己尿了一床吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9E26B264B431B503","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1222608007:1":{"text":"てめえ！その魚くせぇ口を今すぐ黙らせてやる！","source_cn":"该死！我非得撕烂你这张鱼腥味的臭嘴！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3247AEDB743F0716","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1222608008:1":{"text":"いい加減にしろ！","source_cn":"——都别吵了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6147D8C14F91BC69","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1222608009:1":{"text":"旦那！？ちょうどいいところに、こいつが――","source_cn":"二当家？你来得正好，这家伙他——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x478DFC34C59A383E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1222608010:1":{"text":"ボルス、ここは俺が引き受ける。お前は客の相手をしてこい。","source_cn":"波尔斯，这里交给我，去招呼你的客人们吧。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC46A9AC10185CD04","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1222608011:1":{"text":"ちっ……","source_cn":"……啧。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x80361BF