_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1222608017:1":{"text":"女だってのはすぐに分かった。とんでもないべっぴんさんだって思ったよ。奴の顔を見るまではな……","source_cn":"我知道那是个女人，哼，一看就知道是个漂亮妞。要不是我马...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1D3D540A6273E159","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1222608018:1":{"text":"決して忘れはしない。あの死んだ魚のような白い顔と光る緑色の目……！","source_cn":"她的皮肤死鱼般灰白，还有两只闪着绿光的眼睛！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x50F883107E651FEA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:24:1222608019:1":{"text":"確かにグレイヴボーンの特徴と似ていますね。きっとすごく怖かったでしょう？","source_cn":"的确是亡灵的样貌呢，你当时吓坏了吧？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF42B35DFEFD83008","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:25:1222608020:1":{"text":"ああ……情けねえ話だよ。あそこ一帯の魚は、俺の叫び声で全部逃げちまっただろうな。","source_cn":"是……真丢人啊，我惨叫一声，方圆几百码的鱼都要被我吓跑了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA88FEAA1C21297C7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:26:1222608021:1":{"text":"あのグレイヴボーンもこっちに気付いたはずだが、意外にも俺を襲わずに、そのまま暗闇の中に消えちまったんだ……","source_cn":"那亡灵注意到我，但她竟然没要我的命，而是转身跳进夜色里...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4AD220AB8FDC599D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:27:1222608022:1":{"text":"今言ったことは全部本当だ、誓ってもいい！少しでも嘘があれば、俺をサメの餌にするなり好きにしてくれ！","source_cn":"我发誓，要有半点假话，下次我出海，立刻被浪头卷走喂鲨鱼！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x66D452848421FD4A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:30:1222608023:1":{"text":"なんて物騒な誓い……","source_cn":"哇……真是个严肃的誓言。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA713BEB88B0E728B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:31:1222608024:1":{"text":"ルカ、俺が見たのはそれだけだ。これで分かっただろ？","source_cn":"卢卡，这就是我看见的一切。你们应该明白我的态度了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x394457DB35C13F7E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:32:1222608025:1":{"text":"死海の艦隊なんて見たこともねえし、あのグレイヴボーンが死海の一味だと言ったこともねえ。デマを流したのは俺じゃねえんだ！","source_cn":"我没见过死潮舰队，也没说过那亡灵是死潮的人。造谣的不是我！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0A6C01FE19BE0213","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:33:1222608026:1":{"text":"それは俺たちがきちんと調べる。","source_cn":"我们会查清这一切。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x95A7BB635F91BCF9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","docum