ale":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:47:1222608036:1":{"text":"生存者を集め、力を蓄えてホジキンの仇を討つだろうな。","source_cn":"集结幸存者，积蓄力量，为霍德希金复仇。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD0A582215F94EE45","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:48:1222608037:1":{"text":"彼女はどこにいるのでしょう……カーカスビーチの拠点？","source_cn":"她可能去哪里？兽骨滩的基地吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE36956AC39047C4A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:49:1222608038:1":{"text":"いや、あそこは俺たちがずっと監視している。自分から捕まりに来るほど愚かじゃないだろう。","source_cn":"不，我们一直派人监督着兽骨滩。她如果聪明，不会自投罗网。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x00321C7DD30E128A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:50:1222608039:1":{"text":"それなら、残るは緑水（りょくすい）村の井戸の下で見つけた研究施設しかありませんね。死海の艦隊（モルティア）が、魂と肉体の実験をしていた場所です。","source_cn":"那么，就只有我们在绿水村井底发现的研究基地了。死潮舰队...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x51DE0688A4D8F68C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:51:1222608040:1":{"text":"誰にも気付かれないような場所なのか？","source_cn":"那地方很隐蔽？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2FBC2CEAB3FB7EC6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:52